    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">Sqlite Admin is a free, offline SQLite database manager for Android.\n\nWhat you can do:\n• Open and create .db / .sqlite / .sqlite3 files via the system file picker\n• Browse tables with search, sort, and pagination\n• Edit rows; add, rename, drop, and modify columns (including UNIQUE)\n• Manage indexes; run VACUUM, ANALYZE, and integrity checks\n• Full SQL console with history, named favorites, EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN, and schema autocomplete\n• Export and import CSV, JSON, and SQL dumps\n• Attach extra databases and edit common PRAGMAs\n• Preview BLOB values as hex\n• Multi-language UI and System / Light / Dark themes\n\nAuthor: AmyS3\nEmail: %1$s\nBuilt with: %2$s\n\n© 2026 AmyS3. Free to use and share. No account required.\n\nSQLite keywords and your database contents are shown as stored.</string>
